"También valen Google Gemini (aistudio.google.com, con una capa gratuita limitada) y Anthropic Claude (console.anthropic.com). Con claves de dos proveedores distintos, el segundo resuelve y revisa: modelos distintos se equivocan menos a la vez.": "Google Gemini (aistudio.google.com, with a limited free tier) and Anthropic Claude (console.anthropic.com) also work. With keys from two different providers, the second solves and reviews: different models are less often wrong at the same time.",
