"s.instalar": "Install the app",
"s.ex.lede": "A whole exam of new questions, with the structure of the official call and split by topic according to the forecast. Each question goes through the generator’s five-agent panel and only gets in if it passes. Then you take it as a mock exam with a timer and penalty.",
