"s.exRelleno": "If the agents discard questions and some are missing, fill in with official questions on that topic (marked as official)",
"s.exGen": "Generate the exam",
"s.est": "My study",
"s.est.lede": "Your mistakes come back when due, and the plan tells you on which topics you are losing most points given what is expected in the next exam. Everything is computed and stored in your browser, per exam.",
"s.repaso": "Spaced review of your mistakes",
"s.plan": "Where you gain most points",
"s.banco": "Question bank and exams",
