"s.valGen": "Reliability of AI-generated questions",
"s.valGen.txt": "It is measured with official questions, whose answer we know. Each one goes through the panel twice: with its official answer and with a deliberately wrong answer, as if the writer had made a mistake. That shows how many good ones it accepts and how many wrong ones it lets through.",
"s.calibMia": "Measure it with my key (50 questions, about 25 calls)",
"s.valFuente": "Code and data",
"s.valFuente.txt": "Everything is open: the code, the official PDFs and the extraction report for each exam are in the GitHub repository.",
"s.informe": "Extraction report",
